2) Intervention playbook by risk tier
3) Capacity allocation plan by team role
4) Save-plan KPI table: retention_probability_shift, renewal_rate, escalation_rate

Rules:
- Every at-risk account must have owner and deadline.
- Distinguish product issues from relationship issues.
