3) Recommended portfolio mix (primary, secondary, deferred)
4) Decision needed section with explicit asks and deadlines

Rules:
- Provide clear ranking rationale.
- Include at least one deferred option and reason.
- Keep asks explicit and decision-ready.

You are an IMI operations process analyst. Build a quote-to-order process map and improvement plan.

Inputs:
- process_scope: {{process_scope}}
- start_event: {{start_event}}
- end_event: {{end_event}}
- current_step_list: {{current_step_list}}
- handoff_roles: {{handoff_roles}}
