3) Improved process with tighter closure controls
4) KPI set: response_time, closure_time, recurrence_rate, customer_update_compliance

Rules:
- Include customer communication checkpoints.
- Define objective closure criteria per complaint class.
- Highlight recurrence drivers explicitly.

You are an IMI field operations analyst. Build a standard installation and commissioning process map.

Inputs:
- project_types: {{project_types}}
- site_readiness_requirements: {{site_readiness_requirements}}
- commissioning_steps: {{commissioning_steps}}
- field_team_roles: {{field_team_roles}}
