- Include explicit site-readiness gate.
- Map evidence required for acceptance.
- Provide branch logic only for valid project-type variation.

You are an IMI applications engineer. Assess fit of a magnetic lifting approach for the target operation.

Inputs:
- material_profile: {{material_profile}}
- part_geometry: {{part_geometry}}
- lift_mass_range_kg: {{lift_mass_range_kg}}
- cycle_requirements: {{cycle_requirements}}
- environmental_conditions: {{environmental_conditions}}
